{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackHypothesis","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackHypothesis","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.HeckeMonodromy","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.heckeMonodromy_of_kz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.heckeMonodromy_of_kz","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L79-L89","doc":"The Step-2 class assembled from the KZ hypothesis plus the relations that per-generator\nconjugacy does **not** supply (braid, far commutation, classical shadow). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.quad_of_kz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.quad_of_kz","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L72-L77","doc":"**Derived:** every substrate generator satisfies the Hecke quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.quad_of_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.quad_of_conj","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L59-L70","doc":"Conjugation preserves the Hecke quadratic: `(u k u⁻¹)² = u k² u⁻¹ = h • (u k u⁻¹) + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.conj_kz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.conj_kz","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L52-L52","doc":"For every lasso there is a KZ generator `k` with the Hecke quadratic (Kohno–Drinfeld) and a\nunit `u` conjugating it to the substrate generator (the measured half-twist lift). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KZPullbackGenerators","kind":"class","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KZPullbackHypothesis.lean#L45-L52","doc":"**Dependent conjecture (Step-2 option C).** Each substrate generator is conjugate, in the\ntower, to a Knizhnik–Zamolodchikov monodromy generator satisfying the Hecke quadratic with the\nlevel's `q`. The class carries the hypothesis; the quadratic on `T.g i` is derived below. ","signatureChunk":0}]}